msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-outputs/020f7f7d-2888-42af-b447-9f6266437584-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Výstup předchozí buňky kódu](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-outputs/020f7f7d-2888-42af-b447-9f6266437584-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
